{"suttaId":"tha-ap446","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[887,913],"vripara":"22"},"segments":{"tha-ap446:0.3":"Bhallātadāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap446:1.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, dvattiṃsavaralakkhaṇaṃ;","tha-ap446:1.3":"Vipinaggena [pavanaggena (sī. syā. pī.)] gacchantaṃ, sālarājaṃva phullitaṃ.","tha-ap446:2.1":"“Tiṇattharaṃ paññāpetvā, buddhaseṭṭhaṃ ayācahaṃ;","tha-ap446:2.3":"‘Anukampatu maṃ buddho, bhikkhaṃ icchāmi dātave’.","tha-ap446:3.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, atthadassī mahāyaso;","tha-ap446:3.3":"Mama saṅkappamaññāya, orūhi mama assame.","tha-ap446:4.1":"“Orohitvāna sambuddho, nisīdi paṇṇasanthare;","tha-ap446:4.3":"Bhallātakaṃ gahetvāna, buddhaseṭṭhassadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap446:5.1":"“Mama nijjhāyamānassa, paribhuñji tadā jino;","tha-ap446:5.3":"Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, abhivandiṃ tadā jinaṃ.","tha-ap446:6.1":"“Aṭṭhārase kappasate, yaṃ phalamadadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap446:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap446:7.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap446:8.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap446:9.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap446:10.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā bhallātadāyako thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap446:11.1":"Bhallātadāyakattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
